Upa
$cards
DECK 8 SPADES

$initial
DRAW 94 ROTATE 1 U 2
DRIOJAN 1 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
DRIOJAN 9 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

$moves
MOVE DRIOJAN DRIOJAN
AND
    OR
        DEST Rank 1
        SRC Suit {DIAMONDS, CLUBS}
    DEST Empty
MOVE_STACK DRIOJAN DRIOJAN
DEST Empty
$win
OR
    AND
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
        PILE ALL DRIOJAN Empty
    PILE ALL DRAW Empty
